 # Relux SwiftUI Sample
 
-[![Swift 6.0+](https://img.shields.io/badge/Swift-6.0+-red?logo=swift)](https://swift.org/download/)
+[![Swift 6.2+](https://img.shields.io/badge/Swift-6.2+-red?logo=swift)](https://swift.org/download/)
